<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Pustý žleb–Macocha circuit — Pustý žleb–Macocha circuit</name><desc>From Vilémovice, descend through Suchý žleb past the Kateřinská cave area to Skalní mlýn. Follow the blue-marked Pustý žleb approach past the Punkva resurgence and Punkevní cave entrance, then climb through Čertova vrata to the upper Macocha viewing bridge. Return to Vilémovice on the red-marked trail. Cave tours and the cable car are optional visits outside this walking circuit.

